  "raw_label": "appellant_won",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Vilas S/O. Daulatrao Chandankhede vs State Of Mah. Thr. Pso, Ps, Chimur, Tah. ... on 7 February, 2024 2024:Bhc-Nag:1577 1 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Nagpur Bench : Nagpur Criminal Application (Aba) No. 31/2024 Vilas Daulatrao Chandankhede V/s State of Maharashtra Office Notes, Office Memoranda of Court's or Judge's Order Coram, appearances, Court's Orders or directions and Registrar's order Ms. Meena Hiwase. Ghare, counsel for the applicant. Mr. A.G.Mate, App for the non-applicant/State. Coram : Urmila Joshi-Phalke, J. Dated : 07/02/2024. 1. Apprehending arrest at the hands of police, in connection with Crime No. 469/2023 registered with Police Station Chimur, District Chandrapur for the offences punishable under Sections 188, 273, 328 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860 and Sections 26(2)(i), 26(ii) (iv), 30(2)(a) and 59 of the Food and Safety Standards Act, 2006.",
    "facts": "The applicant approached this Court for grant of pre-arrest bail. The driver of the vehicle was arrested and during inquiry, the name of the present applicant revealed as manufacturer and the supplier of the said contraband articles.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the applicant submitted that as the entire contraband is already seized by the Police and the custodial interrogation of the present applicant is not required. In view of that, the interim protection granted to the present applicant deserves to be confirmed."
  },
